error[SC0411]: `*m` may be read before anything was assigned to it
   ╭─[ a_block_made_on_one_arm_only_keeps_its_mark_where_the_arms_meet.c:6:10 ]
   │
 6 │     int *r = *m; if (!r) return 0;
   │          ───┬──  
